owspan="1" colspan="1">Weight % of Na</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Untreated</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">99.94</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.06</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Treated with 1N NaOH for 10 min</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">99.82</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.18</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Treated with 1N NaOH for 30 min</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">99.72</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.28</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1-ijn-3-391"><label>*</label><p><bold>Note:</bold> Data not statistically different.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>